Subject: [PATCH 0986/3799] soh: rename func_800C1AE8 ->
 PreRender_CopyImageTinted

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence GUESS) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the argument-shortening wrapper for the above, in the same shape as PreRender_CopyImageRegion wrapping PreRender_CopyImageRegionImpl; it passes opaque white, so in practice it is a plain 1-cycle copy.
Defined in soh/src/code/PreRender.c.

Tagged [LLM:GUESS] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
